OL,3,GNEWSAThree firefighters taken to
OL,4,Ahospital after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree firefighters have been taken to
OL,7,Fhospital following a collision between
OL,8,Fa fire engine and three other vehicles.
OL,10,FNorthamptonshire Fire and Rescue said
OL,11,Fit happened when the crew was
OL,12,Fresponding to an incident at about
OL,13,F11:00 BST on Tuesday.
OL,15,FThe crash happened on the northbound
OL,16,Fsection of the A43, by Barford Bridge,
OL,17,Fbetween Kettering and Corby. It
OL,18,Finvolved a lorry, car and a van.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
