OL,3,GNEWSAThree firefighters taken to
OL,4,Ahospital after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe firefighters received
OL,7,F"precautionary checks" at Kettering
OL,8,FGeneral Hospital and have now returned
OL,9,Fhome. Police are investigating, the
OL,10,Fservice confirmed.
